      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nits:\n\n- `-o`/`--output` is accepted for `run` and the REPL and silently ignored. `vali -o bo main.scm` runs and makes no `bo`. Refuse it outside `build`.\n- An empty `--cache-dir\u003d` is accepted and writes entries to `./\u003cstamp\u003e/` in the current directory. Then `cache dir` prints an empty line, and `stats` reports 0 entries because `read_dir(\"\")` fails. An empty `VALI_CACHE_DIR` counts as unset; treat the flag the same, or refuse it.",
